      "value": "Is it maybe just only logging Error level logs if \"Logging\" is disabled?\n\nI would say it is fine if it just limits what is logged, but then the option needs to be renamed to \"enable debug logging\" instead.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
