      "value": "@{610d538d5303a82960a415b4|full_name} \n\nThere's multiple launch-options for logs/debug-stuff, pretty sure folks who know already know. \n\nUnleashing that lvl of verbosity at \"Joe User\" imo could even increase support-cases if its too easy to enable accidentally (QM). xD\n\nWhen I - both as tech-person AND enduser - disable logs in an application I really dont expect to see cryptic error-msgs suggesting somethings so borked overriding the users choice is warranted. Especially since (not) logging \"worked as designed\" until recently.\n\nI spent quite a while trying to figure this out the other day as those errors really didnt look healthy to me as non udon savvy person. \n\nMy inner tech directly went into problem-solving mode as vrc had crashed on me twice within 15min, aswell as performance in general felt off compared to pre update.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
