      "value": "@{5fe0a7b0149d3c2965c6f43f|full_name}, the pictures in your opening post only has \"Error\" level logs, which is why I am asking if it still logs Error level logs when logging is disabled. Or maybe your pictures are just bad.\n\nI haven't tried turning off logging, so I don't know what it does.\n\nThose commandline arguments are only for additional logging for SDK and Udon.",
