      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat has actually always output error messages even with the Logging option switched off. Fairly recent changes to how the client writes messages to its output file means that these error logs were reaching that file when they previously weren't.\n\nWe can't completely disable this behavior for compatibility reasons, so instead, we're updating the Logging setting to let you choose between three behaviors: logging everything, logging errors only, or logging nothing at all.",
